c=card('Zealot\'s Flame');c['duration']='Concentration; maximum three rounds';c['cost']='3 RP; optional 1 RP per aura pulse after the first';c['effect']=c['effect'].replace('At the start of each hostile undead creature\'s turn in your aura, if it is one of your current aura targets, it takes 1d6 radiant damage.','On activation choose up to three hostile undead in your aura; they take 1d6 radiant damage. At the start of each of your next two turns you may pay 1 RP to repeat this pulse against up to three current aura targets. Each target is affected once per round. If you decline upkeep, the aura pulses end; the weapon buff may continue for the remaining duration.')
c=card('Vow Absolute');c['duration']='Until encounter ends, you voluntarily speak, or one minute, whichever is first';c['effect']=c['effect'].replace('half its rolled Smite dice total','half its base rolled Smite dice total before critical extra dice');c['effect']+=' At each selected enemy’s turn start it makes a Charisma save, using verbal components normally on success; the aura does not remove nonverbal abilities.'
