c=card('Echo of the Fallen');c['effect']+=' The single spirit strike uses PB+CHA to hit and S d8+M damage of the original weapon type if the recorded profile would exceed either value. It consumes the shared damaging-companion-action budget for that round; no monster or high-level player stat-block duplication.'
c=card('Dirge of Passage');c['effect']=c['effect'].replace('Hostile undead in your aura are vulnerable to radiant damage from your Paladin features','Up to three selected hostile undead in your aura take an additional S radiant damage from your first damaging Paladin feature each round');c['effect']+=' This flat rider replaces blanket damage vulnerability and never doubles a whole attack.'
c=card('Unbreakable Bond');c['effect']=c['effect'].replace('against Charm or compulsion','against a mind-control effect not already prevented by this spell’s immunities')
